The OKF reference agent's approach to frontmatter parsing/validation, its
reserved-file conventions (index.md, log.md), its §8 index.md layout, and its
error-as-instruction pattern for the augmentation guard informed this
implementation. Where the reference agent synthesizes directory descriptions by
calling an LLM (Gemini), this project deliberately substitutes a deterministic
composition function: the CLI never calls an LLM (see docs/adr/0002).

